  "schema:name": "Governance & Compliance Layer ",
  "schema:description": "This application component enforces policies, standards, access controls, audit requirements, and regulatory rules across healthcare quality monitoring systems. It provides oversight and control mechanisms to ensure compliant and secure operations.\r\n\r\nThe purpose is to strengthen healthcare governance, accountability, and regulatory adherence. It also supports secure and standardized management of healthcare quality information.\r\n\r\nExample: Only authorized quality officers are allowed to modify national healthcare quality indicator definitions within the syste",
